All tests pass. Summary of the change:

## Problem
The `server` package tests (`server/model_recommendations_test.go`) referenced a model-recommendations cache endpoint that didn't exist: no `api.ModelRecommendation` types, no cache, no handler, no route.

## Changes (source files only)

**`api/types.go`** — added the wire types:
- `ModelRecommendation` (`model`, `description`, `context_length`, `max_output_tokens`, `vram`)
- `ModelRecommendationsResponse` (`recommendations`)

**`server/model_recommendations.go`** (new) — the full cache + endpoint implementation:
- `defaultModelRecommendations` — fallback list (kimi-k2.6:cloud, glm-5.1:cloud, qwen3.5:cloud, minimax-m2.7:cloud, gemma4, qwen3.5)
- `modelRecommendationsCache` with:
  - `refresh(ctx)` — GETs `modelRecommendationsURL`, short-circuits with `errModelRecommendationsNoCloud` when `envconfig.NoCloud()`, validates the payload, atomically replaces the cache + persists a snapshot only on success (all error paths — transport, non-200, bad JSON, duplicates, empty/invalid cloud entries — preserve current data and skip snapshot writes)
  - `GetSWR(ctx)` — stale-while-revalidate: returns cached data immediately, triggers one async refresh at a time, throttled by `modelRecommendationsReadRefreshCooldown` (also after failures)
  - `persistSnapshot`/`loadSnapshot`/`modelRecommendationsSnapshotPath` — snapshot at `~/.ollama/model_recommendations.json`, invalid snapshots never overwrite existing data
- `validateModelRecommendations` — trims fields, drops cloud entries missing context/output limits, rejects duplicate model names
- `ModelRecommendationsExperimentalHandler` — serves the cache (via SWR), or defaults when no cache is attached

**`server/routes.go`**:
- Added `modelRecommendations *modelRecommendationsCache` to `Server`
- Registered `GET /api/experimental/model-recommendations` (POST correctly yields 405)
- `Serve()` initializes the cache (`newModelRecommendationsCache()`, which loads any local snapshot)

## Verification
- `go build ./...` clean
- `go test ./server ./api` — all pass (including all 11 model-recommendation tests)
- `gofmt`/`go vet` clean; no `*_test.go` files touched
